gametitle=Busin 0: Wizardry Alternative NEO (SLPM-65378)
comment=FIX B (v175) LIVE PROOF -- strncpy shrink @0x121568 + 3 font tables (ADV 0x1215B4 / LSH 0x121614 / ADV2 0x121674) + cave table-read repoints (lui 0x12 / lbu 0x15B4/0x1614/0x1674). 32-bit extended writes (addr top nibble 2 = word). EE addr == EXE VA.
// APPLY OVER the existing translated ISO (the caves + renderer hooks are already installed by the v148+ build; this pnach only (a) writes the shrunk strncpy + the 3 metric tables into the freed span and (b) repoints the 8 table-reader caves off the old 0x580xxx/arena locations into 0x1215xx). Boot fresh, enter a battle (monster loads = arena-pristine battle fix) and open chargen (proportional font = tables read). Once proven, bake by leaving FIX B in the build (already shipped in build/SLPM_653.78_patched).

// --- (1) freed strncpy span: 76B replacement + ADV/LSH/ADV2 (95B each) ---
